    (uuid 4fe4e943-ece9-40b1-ac9f-cfae24a06ffb)
  )
  (text "- A digit ticks when the previous digit rolls over: ones use Q4 falling (9->0), tens use Q3 falling (6->0 reset)." (at 15.24 314.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 159ff53b-5a53-4475-8749-a3e929e7a73e)
  )
  (text "- Seconds are counted (U2B, U3A) but not displayed. After power-up, bridge JP2 (hours) then JP1 (minutes) with a jumper wire." (at 15.24 320.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 49817b30-f0d3-4498-af39-c5cc28435692)
  )
  (text "- Every unused CMOS input is tied to +5V or GND. Unused outputs are marked no-connect." (at 15.24 325.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 94ac8d81-7598-43fa-85f9-358402caba43)
  )
  (text "- Small sideways arrow = +5V, small sideways ground = GND (values hidden to keep pin rows readable)." (at 15.24 330.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ec425856-8c04-4e1e-b50c-bc59f9c6a087)
  )
  (text "- DS1-DS4 use the KiCad SM420561N symbol: same 10-pin common-cathode pinout as the 5161AS. Check your part." (at 15.24 335.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c09ace47-794b-46a8-8fc6-01c6be6c3bac)
  )
  (text "- Breadboard build: footprints are filled in only so this can become a PCB later." (at 15.24 340.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8f589838-44ef-4294-a2d7-1a9ffe0dc4b6)
